      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The \"fake\" tracker's role is already set to disabled by StarVR so applications should ignore it, but I VRChat doesn't evaluate the tracker roles. I also made a feature request for that https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/use-trackers-assigned-roles\nIt's really a shame because the StarVR One would work nicely with VRC even with full body tracking if it wasn't for that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
